msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Ing kasus iki, iku metadata saka buku kaya sing dilaporake dening Z-Library. Ing tingkat paling dhuwur kita mung duwe \"aacid\" lan \"metadata\", nanging ora ana \"data_folder\", amarga ora ana data binar sing cocog. AACID ngemot \"22430000\" minangka ID utama, sing bisa kita deleng dijupuk saka \"zlibrary_id\". Kita bisa ngarepake AAC liyane ing koleksi iki duwe struktur sing padha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Saiki ayo kita mbukak <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Iki minangka metadata AAC sing luwih cilik, sanajan sebagian besar AAC iki ana ing papan liya ing file binar! Sawise kabeh, kita duwe \"data_folder\" wektu iki, mula kita bisa ngarepake data binar sing cocog bakal ana ing <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. \"Metadata\" ngemot \"zlibrary_id\", mula kita bisa kanthi gampang ngaitake karo AAC sing cocog ing koleksi \"zlib_records\". Kita bisa ngaitake kanthi macem-macem cara, contone liwat AACID — standar ora nemtokake iku."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Cathetan yen ora perlu kanggo lapangan \"metadata\" dhewe dadi JSON. Bisa uga dadi string sing ngemot XML utawa format data liyane. Sampeyan bisa uga nyimpen informasi metadata ing blob binar sing gegandhengan, contone yen iku akeh data."

