msgstr "Sampeyan bisa nyumbang kanthi menyang <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Arsipé Anna</a> lan ngeklik tombol “Donate”. Kita uga nggoleki luwih akeh sukarelawan: insinyur piranti lunak, peneliti keamanan, ahli pedagang anonim, lan penerjemah. Sampeyan uga bisa ndhukung kita kanthi nyedhiyakake layanan hosting. Lan mesthi, tulung sebarake torrent kita!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Matur nuwun kanggo kabeh wong sing wis kanthi loman ndhukung kita! Sampeyan pancen nggawe bedane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
